name=Viewpoint QOL - Nearby Containers Fix (ZB)
id=ViewpointQOLLootFix
description=Makes Project Viewpoint QOL's "See All Nearby Containers" reach the container you aim at. QOL's LootTargets.aimed patch asks ZombieBuddy for a writable Object return value, but aimed() returns LootTargets$Target, so Byte Buddy refuses it and it never applies. This mod applies the same code with a read-only return value (the code only reads it), so QOL works as its author intended; no QOL files are changed. Turns itself off if QOL's patch class changes. <LINE>Requires ZombieBuddy, Viewpoint and Project Viewpoint QOL.
modversion=1.0.0
versionMin=42.22
require=\ZombieBuddy,\Viewpoint,\ProjectViewpointQOL
loadModAfter=\ZombieBuddy,\Viewpoint,\ProjectViewpointQOL
ZBVersionMin=2.3.0
javaJarFile=media/java/client/ViewpointQOLLootFix.jar
javaPkgName=viewpointqollootfix
